\par\par \b \uc2 The  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  of the Russian Federation\uc2  (Bank of Russia)-On parameters of Bank of Russia exchange rate policy\b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 November 2014\par \uc2 ENP Newswire\par \uc2 ENPNEW\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2014, Electronic News Publishing. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 Release date - 05112014\par \par \uc2 Effective from 5 November 2014, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  adjusted its approach to \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the borders of the floating \b \highlight22\uc2 operational\b0 \highlight\uc2  band to further increase the ruble exchange rate flexibility.\par \par \uc2 As the ruble value of the dual-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket reaches the upper/lower border of the floating \b \highlight22\uc2 operational\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, the Bank of Russia will carry out foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  buy/sell \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  with the intensity equal to $350 million per day. Hence, in case the value of the dual-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket stays on or outside the borders of the \b \highlight22\uc2 operational\b0 \highlight\uc2  band during the whole trading session, the volume of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  will not increase $350 million. At the same time, in case of financial stability threats, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be ready to carry out additional \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the automatic rule of \b \highlight22\uc2 operational\b0 \highlight\uc2  band borders adjustment remains valid under which there is an automatic 5-kopeck upward/downward border shift in case the cumulative volume of Bank of Russia foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  buy/sell \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  reaches $350 million.\par \par \uc2 The above-mentioned adjustments will increase significantly the ruble exchange rate flexibility and at the same time will drive for a supply and demand balance in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. Besides, the abandonment of unlimited \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the borders of the \b \highlight22\uc2 operational\b0 \highlight\uc2  band will hamper prerequisites for speculative strategies against the ruble.\par \par \uc2 As a result of the implementation of this decision, the ruble exchange rate will be determined predominantly by the market factors.\par \par \uc2 [Editorial queries for this story should be sent to newswire@enpublishing.co.uk]\par \par \uc2 Dokument ENPNEW0020141106eab6000i4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
