\par\par \b \uc2 *Bank Of Russia Deputy Head Yudaeva: Repo Auctions To Become Main Monetary Tool\b0\par\par\uc2 394 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 November 2014\par 11:55\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2014, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 5 Nov 2014 05:56 ET *Bank of Russia Yudaeva: Fears Ruble Will Drop When Floating Are Exaggerated\par \par \uc2 5 Nov 2014 05:57 ET *Bank of Russia Yudaeva Says Further Rate Increase Can't Be Ruled Out\par \par \uc2 5 Nov 2014 05:57 ET *Bank of Russia's Yudaeva: More Changes Too Ruble Trading Mechanism Ahead\par \par \uc2 5 Nov 2014 05:58 ET *Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Won't Announce \b \highlight22\uc2 Interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  Needed For Financial Stability In Advance\par \par \uc2 5 Nov 2014 05:59 ET *Yudaeva: New \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Mechanism to Ease Speculative Pressure on Ruble\par \par \uc2 5 Nov 2014 05:59 ET *Bank Of Russia's Yudaeva: \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Market Expected to Stabilize By Year-End\par \par \uc2 5 Nov 2014 06:00 ET *Bank Of Russia's Yudaeva: Reserves Are in "Comfortable Zone"\par \par \uc2 5 Nov 2014 06:00 ET *Bank Of Russia's Yudaeva: Reserve Level Doesn't Limit Size Of Bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 Operations\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 5 Nov 2014 06:03 ET *Bank Of Russia's Yudaeva: Inflation Won't Slow to CBR Target in 2015\par \par \uc2 5 Nov 2014 06:20 ET  Bank of Russia's Yudaeva: \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Market Expected to Stabilize by Year-End\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Andrey Ostroukh \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 MOSCOW--The turmoil in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market which sent the ruble to record lows is likely to stabilize by the end of the year, Ksenia Yudaeva, the Bank of Russia's first deputy chairwoman, said Wednesday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  announced Wednesday that it would drastically cut back \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and allow the ruble's exchange rate to be set "primarily by market factors," as the Russian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  continued to face heavy selling pressure even after a major rate increase announced Friday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Ms. Yudaeva said market fears that the ruble will drop when the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  lets it float freely are exaggerated. She said that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is preparing for more changes to the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  mechanism but won't announce them in advance. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  had earlier pledged to scrap \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and the ruble trading band at the beginning of 2015.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Ms. Yudaeva said that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's reserves are in a "comfortable zone" now and their size does not limit the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on the market.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -Write to Andrey Ostroukh at andrey.ostroukh@wsj.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 November 05, 2014 06:20 ET (11:20 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020141105eab5001ny\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
