\par\par \b \uc2 Russian Ruble Hits Fresh Low Against Dollar--Update\b0\par\par\uc2 By Andrey Ostroukh \par \uc2 615 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Oktober 2014\par 12:39\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2014, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW--The Russian ruble's free fall extended into new record-breaking territory Monday, prompting fresh questions over how authorities can try to let the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  float freely without producing sky-high inflation.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reference basket of euros and dollars jumped in value to over 44.55 against the ruble early Monday. The dollar popped above 40 against the ruble for the first time, building on months of pressure that has been building on the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  since tensions flared up between Russia and Ukraine in March.\par \par \uc2 Analysts said upbeat jobs data from the U.S. Friday was helping to push up the dollar against many emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but also said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Russia\uc2  may be pushed into additional efforts to calm the ruble's slide, particularly as the decline bumps up inflation through higher import costs.\par \par \uc2 "We reiterate that an ahead-of-schedule rate hike would be a positive sign for the market, while failure to do so would indicate that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be facing obstacles to transitioning to ruble free-float," said analysts at \uc2 Alfa Bank\uc2  said. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  left its key rates unchanged last month and is scheduled to meet on the monetary policy again on Oct 31. It didn't immediately respond to a request for comment on the latest slide in the ruble.\par \par \uc2 The ruble, hit by capital flight, an economic slowdown and Western sanctions, has come under increased selling pressure in the past few weeks as the price of oil-the country's key export-has tumbled below $100 per barrel. Brent crude prices hovered at $92.60 per barrel on Monday, some $10 below an average price factored into Russia's 2014 budget.\par \par \uc2 The Bank of Russia's says that it targets no specific ruble rate and will let the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  float freely starting from 2015, although it also says it retains the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if it deems that the ruble's weakening poses risks for financial stability. Last week, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and finance ministry denied speculation that the country is preparing capital controls to deal with the issue.\par \par \uc2 For now, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has continued \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 . On Friday, it shifted the permitted trading band for the euro-and-dollar basket against the ruble by 10 kopecks to 35.50-44.50 allowing the ruble to weaken a little more, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's data showed Monday. Official data suggest the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent at least $700 million from its reserves to limit the ruble's slide last week.\par \par \uc2 The country's gold and foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, the world's fourth largest, stood at $457 billion in late September.\par \par \uc2 In an attempt to feed the dollar-hungry market, the Bank of Russia pledged to launch a new lending tool--\b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  repo--where it will provide the market with foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But analysts now doubt that the current measures could be enough to save the ruble from further depreciation.\par \par \uc2 "The main question for the Russian market now is: [whether and] when the regulator going to give a bold response to the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  volatility?" VTB Capital analysts said in a note.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  usually carries out a predictable policy but in early March, the bank unexpectedly raised interest rates and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily to prop up the ruble, hit by fears of the ruble impact of Moscow's annexation of Crimea.\par \par \uc2 Tommy Stubbington contributed to this article.\par \par \uc2 Write to Andrey Ostroukh at andrey.ostroukh@wsj.com<mailto:andrey.ostroukh@wsj.com>\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 October 06, 2014 06:39 ET (10:39 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020141006eaa6000rl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
