\par\par \b \uc2 Rouble hits new historic low vs dollar in early trade\b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 September 2014\par 08:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2014 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Sept 29 (Reuters) - The rouble hit a new all-time low against the dollar on Monday, hurt by a stronger U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and weakening oil prices, but Russian shares opened mixed as signs of progress in a gas-pricing dispute between Russia and Ukraine offered some support.\par \par \uc2 At 0620 GMT, the rouble was 0.47 percent weaker against the dollar at 39.36 and lost 0.57 percent to trade at 49.90 versus the euro.\par \par \uc2 That left the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  0.52 percent weaker at 44.10 against the dollar-euro basket the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  uses to gauge the rouble's nominal exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 The basket also hit an all-time low in early trade. Once the basket reaches 44.40, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  carries out unlimited \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rouble-based MICEX index traded 0.4 percent higher at 1,440 points, while the dollar-denominated RTS was 0.2 percent lower at 1,153 points.\par \par \uc2 On Friday, \uc2 European Union\uc2  and Russian officials suggested Ukraine and Russia were moving closer to a deal that would guarantee Kiev at least 5 billion cubic metres of gas for the next six months if Ukraine made pre-payments.\par \par \uc2 "The bulls are still under pressure due to the weak rouble and cheapening oil, but progress between Russia and Ukraine on the gas question and the potential removal of sanctions are capable of providing a short-term boost to the market," analysts at Energo Kapital investment firm said in a note.\par \par \uc2 For rouble poll data see\par \par \uc2 For Russian equities guide see\par \par \uc2 For Russian treasury bonds see\par \par \uc2 Russia in graphics: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/dun63s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/dun63s}}}\uc2  (Reporting by Alexander Winning; Editing by Lidia Kelly) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2014-9-29T07:36:17.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020140929ea9t0061n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
