\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Russian c.bank moves closer to free float by widening rouble corridor\b0\par\par\uc2 504 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 August 2014\par 10:24\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2014 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds detail, comments)\par \par \uc2 By Oksana Kobzeva and Alexander Winning\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Aug 18 (Reuters) - \uc2 Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday moved a step closer to its goal of a freely floating rouble exchange rate by widening its trading corridor for the rouble and reducing the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  it carries out to move the corridor.\par \par \uc2 The moves are part of a long-term policy shift to make inflation a more important benchmark than the exchange rate after several months earlier in the year when the bank was forced to defend the rouble, which came under pressure due to the crisis in neighbouring Ukraine.\par \par \uc2 As part of the plan, the rouble's trading corridor will be abolished altogether from January next year and regular daily \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  will cease, although the bank will reserve the right to make discretionary \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the interests of financial stability.\par \par \uc2 The bank said in a statement that starting from Monday it had widened its exchange-rate corridor by 2 roubles to 9 roubles and reduced the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  threshold for moving the corridor against a dollar-euro basket to $350 million from $1 billion.\par \par \uc2 It also said it would stop carrying out \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  within the corridor to reduce exchange rate volatility.\par \par \uc2 "The stated changes have been made within the framework of moving to an inflation-targeting regime, one of the essential conditions for the successful realisation of which is stopping managing the exchange rate," the bank said, reiterating that it aims to move to a free float by next year.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves would normally be bearish for the rouble, as the bank will be less active in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to guide the rouble's exchange rate, but the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  temporarily ignored the move in early trading, supported by the approaching end-of-month tax period.\par \par \uc2 The rouble was 0.36 percent stronger against the dollar and 0.37 percent firmer versus the euro at 0800 GMT.\par \par \uc2 Alexander Morozov, chief economist for Russia and CIS at \uc2 HSBC\uc2 , said Monday's policy move would likely be followed by a cancellation of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to move the corridor, effectively completing the shift to a freely floating rouble.\par \par \uc2 "Given that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has inflation at the top of its list of priorities, this requires a tighter monetary policy so as not to lose the trust of market participants," he said.\par \par \uc2 In March, \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  dramatically raised the size of its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  threshold, to $1.5 billion from $350 million, after the escalating Ukraine crisis caused a massive rouble sell-off, heightening concerns about Russia's overall financial stability.\par \par \uc2 The higher threshold paved the way for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to spend some $25 billion to defend the rouble, but in June it signalled its policy shift was back on track by reducing the size of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market fluctuations. (Additional reporting by Katya Golubkova; Editing by Christian Lowe and Andewq Heavens) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2014-8-18T09:24:33.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020140818ea8i003st\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
